    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Don&#8217;t work? Open ticket, we answer in max 48h.</strong></p>\n<p>You can easily view all image size names and dimensions in a page under Tools.</p>\n<p><strong>Need to manage sizes generation?</strong> Use our plugin <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/disable-thumbnails-and-threshold/\" title=\"Disable Thumbnails, Threshold and Image Options\" rel=\"ugc\">Disable Thumbnails, Threshold and Image Options</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the &#8216;/wp-content/plugins/&#8217; directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins page directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; page in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Open the plugin page in Tools -&gt; Image Sizes.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<h4>\nWhere I can view list of thumbnails image sizes?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can found plugin page inside Tools -&gt; Image Sizes.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Code review and WordPress coding standards, translatable strings.</li>\n<li>Minimum WordPress version raised to 4.6.</li>\n<li>7.1 compatibility.</li>\n<li>Direct link to the Disable Thumbnails plugin page.</li>\n<li>Image sizes shown in a standard, accessible admin table.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>6.8 compatibility and code revisions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.5.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>6.6 compatibility</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.5.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New name and code revisions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.5.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>5.7 compatibility.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.5.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Version compatibility updated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Version compatibility updated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Small Fix.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New graphic.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Version compatibility updated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Version compatibility updated.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>We are alive!</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bugfix.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
